DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of big laughs and sharp Southern storytel
 ling as Landon Bryant and Mary Ryan Brown bring the Southern Nights Comedy 
 Tour to the stage.\n\nLandon Bryant is a bestselling author whose observati
 ons about Southern life have built a massive following across the country. 
 Known for his viral storytelling and authentic voice\, Bryant connects with
  audiences through humor that feels instantly familiar. His growing popular
 ity has led to sold-out live events and a rapidly expanding national fan ba
 se. A viral Southern humor creator with millions of online views\, he has a
 ppeared on the Grand Ole Opry and Nateland Live at Zanies Nashville.\n\nMar
 y Ryan Brown brings her own fearless perspective to the stage. With razor-s
 harp wit and hilarious takes on relationships\, family life\, and Southern 
 culture\, she has become one of the rising voices in stand-up comedy. Her c
 omedy specials can be seen on Dry Bar Comedy and Nateland Live.\n\nTogether
 \, Landon Bryant and Mary Ryan Brown deliver a fast-paced night of stand-up
  filled with stories you’ll recognize\, characters you’ve met\, and lau
 ghs that keep coming from start to finish.\n\nDon’t miss the  Southern N
 ights Comedy Tour  — a night of comedy that celebrates the humor\, stori
 es\, and personalities of the South.\n\nVIP includes reserved seat plus a p
 ost-show M&G!\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 foo
 d & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nTh
 ere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfill
 ed with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and dri
 nks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-item minim
 um.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the
  facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore inf
